The normalized vectors are:
\[ u_x = \frac{\frac{\sqrt{2}}{d}x}{\left\| \frac{\sqrt{2}}{d}x \right\|} = \frac{\frac{\sqrt{2}}{d}x}{\sqrt{2}} = \frac{x}{d} \]

