\]

Now, divide the numerator by the denominator:

\[
C_{\text{eq}} = \frac{6000000 \, \text{pF}^2}{5000 \, \text{pF}} = 1200 \, \text{pF}
\]

Therefore, the nominal equivalent capacitance is:

\[
C_{\text{eq}} = 1200 \pm 0 \, \text{pF}
\]

