The fractional error in energy (\(\frac{\Delta E}{E}\)) can be expressed in terms of the fractional errors in capacitance (\(\frac{\Delta C}{C}\)) and voltage (\(\frac{\Delta V}{V}\)). Using error propagation for products and powers, the formula is:

